title: "The Age of AI Infrastructure Hegemony"
message: "This CITATION.cff describes the versioned research repository as CFF type software, as required by CFF 1.2.0 top-level metadata; please cite the monograph using preferred-citation below / 顶层元数据描述可版本化研究仓库，正式专著引用请使用下方 preferred-citation。"
