abstract: "A versioned bilingual research repository for the industry monograph The Age of AI Infrastructure Hegemony, including 40 research volumes, 8 macro essays, and a 32-chapter publication layer on AI infrastructure, semiconductors, memory, advanced packaging, hyperscaler system stacks, power, capital, software economics, labor, and the 2026–2036 industrial endgame."
